  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TAIEX expert mission Swedish Police Serbia</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">TAIEX expertbes&#xf6;k Polismyndigheten Serbien</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Med h&#xe4;nvisning till Sidas Riktlinjer f&#xf6;r Twinning och TAIEX daterad 20140701, beslutsnummer 2014001963, ska Sida st&#xf6;dja och n&#xe4;r s&#xe5; &#xe4;r l&#xe4;mpligt finansiera myndigheters arbete med planering och genomf&#xf6;rande av studiebes&#xf6;k, workshops och expertuppdrag. Sidas st&#xf6;d inom detta beslut avser  Polismyndighetens kostnader f&#xf6;r f&#xf6;rberedelser och genomf&#xf6;rande av TAIEX-uppdraget &#x201d;Expert mission for drafting a situation analisys of necessary human resources, legislation and institutional framework
with a view to efficient international police cooperation, Action Plan, Chapter 24 (Justice, freedom, security).&quot; Expertmissionen &#xe4;ger rum i Serbien 7-10 december 2015.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Swedish Police in preparation, travel-time and         particiation at the TAIEX-mission Expert mission for drafting a       situation analisys of necessary human resources, legislation and      institutional framework with a view to efficient international police cooperation, Action Plan, Chapter 24 (Justice, freedom, security) in  Serbia.</narrative>
  </description>
